{"video":"b8KbWAMJk1g","lines":[{"t":[0,2.9],"en":"Ray Charles famously had this state on his mind."},{"t":[3.6,4.9],"en":"What is its capital?"},{"t":[5.2,6.2],"en":"Oh, we got this."},{"t":[7.8,9.2],"en":"Let's reverse engineer this."},{"t":[9.2,10],"en":"You're a black singer."},{"t":[10.2,10.8],"en":"Where do you go?"},{"t":[11,12.6],"en":"Somewhere where you're a novelty."},{"t":[13.3,13.8],"en":"Alaska?"},{"t":[14,14.3],"en":"Atlanta?"},{"t":[14.8,17.4],"en":"Oh, I know you think that because that's where the Olympics were held."},{"t":[17.7,19],"en":"My cousins were actually at those Olympics."},{"t":[19.3,21],"en":"Keep talking all you want."},{"t":[21.6,23.9],"en":"How am I supposed to know what was on his mind?"},{"t":[24.3,26.6],"en":"Oh, what do blind people think about?"},{"t":[26.6,31.7],"en":"Okay, dogs, canes, signs, manholes, stairs, piano, darkness."},{"t":[31.9,33.2],"en":"Okay, time's up."},{"t":[33.4,35.1],"en":"Let's get the boards up."},{"t":[35.6,37.6],"en":"Atlanta, Georgia is the correct answer."},{"t":[39.9,46.9],"en":"Hey now, you're not an all-star of the NBA,"},{"t":[47.4,51.9],"en":"but you did get your game on when you won the NBA's sixth man of the year award in 2011."},{"t":[52.6,53.6],"en":"Who are you?"},{"t":[54,55.4],"en":"Jim, Daryl, your time to shine."},{"t":[55.8,56.5],"en":"Sean Marion."},{"t":[56.8,57.7],"en":"Yes, Sean Marion."},{"t":[58.1,58.8],"en":"That doesn't sound right."},{"t":[58.9,61.2],"en":"I want to say Le Damien Washington."},{"t":[61.5,62.3],"en":"Wrong for so many reasons."},{"t":[62.6,65.6],"en":"Well, I know Elizabeth Taylor's sixth man was Richard Burton."},{"t":[65.7,66.3],"en":"Is that helpful?"},{"t":[66.6,67.2],"en":"That's it."},{"t":[67.2,68.8],"en":"I'm going to go watch the boats on the river."},{"t":[70.3,71.7],"en":"Ron Artest, Kelly."},{"t":[72.1,73.3],"en":"No, it's Lamar Odom."},{"t":[73.5,75.7],"en":"If it had been Ron Artest, it would have come up in Dancing with the Stars"},{"t":[75.7,78.2],"en":"when they pan over his trophy case when he's at home with his family."},{"t":[79.2,81.9],"en":"Lamar winning sixth man was a big storyline on Chloe and Lamar."},{"t":[81.9,83.3],"en":"All right, boards up."},{"t":[83.8,84.7],"en":"Let's see who got it."},{"t":[85.1,87.7],"en":"Lamar Odom is what we were looking for."},{"t":[88.3,89.2],"en":"Lamar Odom."},{"t":[89.5,90.2],"en":"Oh, my God."},{"t":[90.3,90.8],"en":"Lamar Odom."},{"t":[91.4,92.2],"en":"Nicely done."},{"t":[92.2,93.3],"en":"You're my sports guys."},{"t":[93.9,94.6],"en":"You're ESPN."},{"t":[94.7,95.7],"en":"You're ESPN Classic."},{"t":[96,97.1],"en":"Ryan is MSNBC."},{"t":[97.4,99.1],"en":"I'm ETLC and Oxygen."},{"t":[99.2,99.8],"en":"Chill, man."},{"t":[99.9,100.4],"en":"All right, guys."},{"t":[100.5,102.3],"en":"After nine rounds, let's check the scores."},{"t":[103,106.2],"en":"In first place, with nine points, it's Aesop's foibles."},{"t":[106.2,110.1],"en":"The Querencene Bears have seven points."},{"t":[110.1,113.7],"en":"The Dunder Mifflin A team has four points."},{"t":[113.7,114.4],"en":"All right."},{"t":[114.4,117.1],"en":"The DM backup team has three points."},{"t":[117.6,119.8],"en":"The Einsteins have eight points."},{"t":[120,120.4],"en":"Wow."},{"t":[121.1,123.7],"en":"Ladies Gaga have five points."},{"t":[123.9,129.3],"en":"So our best chance of hitting our mark is now in the hands and brains of Kevin, Meredith,"},{"t":[129.5,130.2],"en":"Aaron, and Kelly."},{"t":[130.9,132],"en":"Do I like these odds?"},{"t":[133.2,134.3],"en":"My answer is no."},{"t":[134.5,140.1],"en":"Who was the relatively unknown patent clerk who discovered that energy equals mass times the"},{"t":[140.1,141.1],"en":"speed of light squared."},{"t":[141.7,143.5],"en":"Looks like everyone gets a point for Albert Einstein."},{"t":[145,146],"en":"Oh, wait."},{"t":[146.8,148.1],"en":"Except for the Einsteins."},{"t":[148.7,149.5],"en":"That's all right."},{"t":[150.1,154],"en":"Which means the top three teams are going to finish it off in the speed round."},{"t":[154.3,155.9],"en":"So let's get everyone some bells."},{"t":[156.1,158.8],"en":"In third place, we have the Einsteins."},{"t":[158.8,159.9],"en":"Oh, yes!"},{"t":[162,164.4],"en":"Second place, we have the Querencene Bears."},{"t":[166.6,169],"en":"And first place is Aesop's foibles."},{"t":[170.1,173.6],"en":"Yeah, but they're going to get clobbered."},{"t":[174.1,175.4],"en":"Ring it in when you know it."},{"t":[175.5,176.2],"en":"First question."},{"t":[177.3,180.6],"en":"This man had a fatwa declared on him when..."},{"t":[180.6,182.5],"en":"Einsteins?"},{"t":[183.1,184.1],"en":"What is it?"},{"t":[184.8,185.6],"en":"I did my part, babe."},{"t":[185.7,186.4],"en":"I'm just the bell girl."},{"t":[188.1,188.6],"en":"Aesop's?"},{"t":[188.8,189.4],"en":"Salman Rushdie."},{"t":[189.9,191],"en":"Salman Rushdie is correct."},{"t":[194.4,195.7],"en":"Heading out to sea, sailors."},{"t":[197.1,198.5],"en":"On a square-rigged ship,"},{"t":[199.1,201.3],"en":"the sail set furthest forward is called what?"},{"t":[203.3,204.2],"en":"Princess Sting Dog."},{"t":[204.3,205],"en":"Do not hit that bell."},{"t":[205,206.1],"en":"Klein Jib."},{"t":[206.6,207.8],"en":"Klein Jib is correct."},{"t":[207.9,208.8],"en":"For the Einsteins."},{"t":[216.8,217.8],"en":"Final round."},{"t":[218.5,220.1],"en":"Last two teams squaring off."},{"t":[220.6,222.5],"en":"I hope you're ready to play Doctor."},{"t":[223,225.9],"en":"Our question is about the health and the human body."},{"t":[226.1,227.1],"en":"Oh, come on."},{"t":[227.3,229.5],"en":"The standard American analog scale"},{"t":[229.5,232],"en":"has a maximum capacity of what weight?"},{"t":[232.4,234.3],"en":"300 pounds."},{"t":[234.6,235.7],"en":"Point for the Einsteins."},{"t":[237,238.4],"en":"Here's your final question."},{"t":[238.8,240.9],"en":"Cinephiles, put on your memory berets."},{"t":[241.4,243],"en":"This 2001 masterpiece"},{"t":[243,245.4],"en":"from Gilles Paquet Brenner"},{"t":[245.4,247.6],"en":"explores the intricate dynamics"},{"t":[247.6,249.5],"en":"of a family in disarray."},{"t":[250.8,252.7],"en":"Le titre du film est"},{"t":[252.7,255],"en":"Le scaphandre et le papillon."},{"t":[255.3,255.5],"en":"Yes."},{"t":[256,256.9],"en":"I'm sorry, no."},{"t":[257,258],"en":"Over to the Einsteins."},{"t":[258.8,260.8],"en":"Les Jolies choses."},{"t":[261.1,261.5],"en":"Are you sure?"},{"t":[262.5,263.9],"en":"Marianne Cotillard"},{"t":[263.9,266.6],"en":"exposes herself"},{"t":[266.6,267.9],"en":"a number of times"},{"t":[267.9,268.9],"en":"in that film."},{"t":[269,269.8],"en":"The Einsteins win it."},{"t":[270.1,270.5],"en":"No!"},{"t":[271.4,272.1],"en":"Come on!"},{"t":[272.3,273.3],"en":"Come on!"},{"t":[273.4,273.7],"en":"Win it!"},{"t":[274.2,274.7],"en":"Look,"},{"t":[275.1,276.5],"en":"I know it's easy to say"},{"t":[276.5,277.9],"en":"tonight was just a fluke"},{"t":[277.9,279.2],"en":"and maybe it was"},{"t":[279.2,281.1],"en":"but here's a piece of trivia."},{"t":[281.9,282.4],"en":"A fluke"},{"t":[282.4,284.2],"en":"is one of the most common fish"},{"t":[284.2,284.8],"en":"in the sea"},{"t":[284.8,286.7],"en":"so if you go fishing"},{"t":[286.7,287.6],"en":"for a fluke"},{"t":[287.6,289.1],"en":"chances are"},{"t":[289.1,291.6],"en":"he just might catch one."},{"t":[291.6,294.7],"en":"Oh my god!"},{"t":[294.8,295.6],"en":"Okay, it's happening!"},{"t":[298.9,299.5],"en":"Oh."},{"t":[299.8,300.4],"en":"My."},{"t":[300.9,301.5],"en":"God!"},{"t":[308.5,309],"en":"Uh-oh."},{"t":[309.5,310.3],"en":"Oh, it's so funny!"},{"t":[310.4,311.1],"en":"Glad to be there!"},{"t":[311.3,312.1],"en":"Oh, okay!"},{"t":[320.7,325.3],"en":"Stay f***ed!"}]}
